Validate the following CTL2 transform for a REFORMAT. The graph uses a `StoreZipLookup` keyed by `zip_code` (string) and returning `StoreRecord` with `store_name` (string); one zip may have several matching store records. The intent is to collect all store names for a given zip code into a list.

Code:
```ctl
//#CTL2
function integer transform() {
    $out.0.zip_code = $in.0.zip_code;

    string[] storeNames;
    StoreRecord s = lookup(StoreZipLookup).next();
    while (!isnull(s)) {
        storeNames = append(storeNames, s.store_name);
        s = lookup(StoreZipLookup).next();
    }
    $out.0.store_names = join(",", storeNames);
    return OK;
}
```

Input metadata (Port 0):
<Metadata id="MetaIn"><Record name="zip_input" type="delimited"><Field name="zip_code" type="string"/></Record></Metadata>

