Create CTL2 for an ExtHashJoin component. Port 0 is the master NgoOnboardingCase input and port 1 is the slave NgoRegistryProfile input. The graph is a left outer join on NgoOnboardingCase.ngo_registration_no = NgoRegistryProfile.ngo_registration_no and NgoOnboardingCase.service_hub = NgoRegistryProfile.service_hub. There is at most one registry profile row for the configured join key.

Port 0 metadata:
<Metadata id="NgoOnboardingCaseIn"><Record name="NgoOnboardingCase" type="delimited"><Field name="onboarding_case_id" type="string"/><Field name="ngo_registration_no" type="string"/><Field name="service_hub" type="string"/><Field name="application_date" type="date"/><Field name="declared_donation_volume" type="decimal"/><Field name="volunteer_count" type="long"/><Field name="overseas_remittance_needed" type="boolean" nullable="false"/></Record></Metadata>

Port 1 metadata:
<Metadata id="NgoRegistryProfileIn"><Record name="NgoRegistryProfile" type="delimited"><Field name="ngo_registration_no" type="string"/><Field name="service_hub" type="string"/><Field name="license_issue_date" type="date"/><Field name="license_expiry_date" type="date" nullable="true"/><Field name="verified_donation_volume" type="number"/><Field name="tax_concession_confirmed" type="boolean" nullable="false"/><Field name="registry_tier" type="string"/></Record></Metadata>

Output metadata:
<Metadata id="NgoOnboardingDecisionOut"><Record name="NgoOnboardingDecision" type="delimited"><Field name="case_reference" type="string"/><Field name="onboarding_decision" type="string"/><Field name="accepted_donation_volume" type="decimal"/><Field name="due_diligence_hold" type="decimal"/><Field name="enabled_remittance_limit" type="decimal"/><Field name="review_note" type="string"/></Record></Metadata>

Business logic:
- A missing registry profile means PENDING_DOCUMENTS, zero monetary outputs, and REGISTRY_PROFILE_MISSING.
- A matched profile is rejected when application_date is before license_issue_date, when application_date is after a non-null license_expiry_date, or when registry_tier is not CLEAR. Rejected cases produce REJECTED, zero monetary outputs, and the reasons APPLICATION_BEFORE_LICENSE, LICENSE_EXPIRED, or REGISTRY_NOT_CLEAR in that precedence.
