    <Field name="service_centre" type="string" nullable="false"/>
    <Field name="filing_route" type="string" nullable="false"/>
    <Field name="returns_count" type="integer"/>
    <Field name="declared_sum_kzt" type="decimal" length="14" scale="2"/>
    <Field name="closure_reason" type="string" nullable="true"/>
  </Record>
</Metadata>

Task: Generate ~365 records per centre (all calendar days in a year) for Astana, Shymkent, and Karaganda. `filing_route` should be `service_centre` on normal working days, but `egov_portal` on Saturdays, Sundays, and 21-23 March. Set `closure_reason` to `NAURYZ` for 21-23 March, `WEEKEND` for other Saturday/Sunday dates, otherwise null. `returns_count` should spike during the main declaration windows (15 March-15 April and 1-15 July); outside those windows it is lower. On dates routed to `egov_portal`, keep counts reduced but still nonzero; on normal working days use higher counts. `declared_sum_kzt` should be derived from `returns_count` using a centre-specific average declaration amount plus small random variation.

PROPOSED CTL2 IMPLEMENTATION:
```ctl
//#CTL2:COMPILE

const date YEAR_START = 2025-01-01;
const date YEAR_END = 2025-12-31;
const date NAURYZ_START = 2025-03-21;
const date NAURYZ_END = 2025-03-23;
const date WINDOW_1_START = 2025-03-15;
const date WINDOW_1_END = 2025-04-15;
const date WINDOW_2_START = 2025-07-01;
const date WINDOW_2_END = 2025-07-15;

string[] centres = ["Astana", "Shymkent", "Karaganda"];
map[string, decimal] avgDeclarations = {
    "Astana" -> 100000D,
    "Shymkent" -> 80000D,
    "Karaganda" -> 90000D
};

date currentDate;
integer centreIndex;

function boolean init() {
    currentDate = YEAR_START;
    centreIndex = 0;
    return true;
}

function integer generate() {
    string centre = centres[centreIndex];
    integer dow = getDayOfWeek(currentDate);

    $out.0.receipt_day = currentDate;
    $out.0.service_centre = centre;

    boolean isNauryz = (currentDate >= NAURYZ_START && currentDate <= NAURYZ_END);
    boolean isWeekend = (dow == 6 || dow == 7);

    if (isNauryz) {
        $out.0.filing_route = "egov_portal";
        $out.0.closure_reason = "NAURYZ";
    } else if (isWeekend) {
        $out.0.filing_route = "egov_portal";
        $out.0.closure_reason = "WEEKEND";
    } else {
        $out.0.filing_route = "service_centre";
        $out.0.closure_reason = null;
    }

    integer baseCount = iif($out.0.filing_route == "egov_portal", 5, 20);
    if ((currentDate >= WINDOW_1_START && currentDate <= WINDOW_1_END) ||
        (currentDate >= WINDOW_2_START && currentDate <= WINDOW_2_END)) {
        baseCount *= 3;
    }

    $out.0.returns_count = baseCount + randomInteger(-3, 3);

    decimal avg = nvl(avgDeclarations[centre], 100000D);
    decimal variation = avg * 0.05D * randomDecimal(-1.0D, 1.0D);
    $out.0.declared_sum_kzt = $out.0.returns_count * (avg + variation);

    centreIndex++;
    if (centreIndex >= length(centres)) {
        centreIndex = 0;
        currentDate = dateAdd(currentDate, 1, day);
        if (currentDate > YEAR_END) {
            return STOP;
        }
    }

    return OK;
}
