ORIGINAL REQUIREMENTS AND METADATA:
Create CTL2 for an ExtHashJoin with master port 0 and slave ports 1 and 2. The component performs left outer joins for a Southeast Asian motor-insurance assistance provider: RoadsideRequest.policy_ref matches Policyholder.policy_ref on port 1, and RoadsideRequest.policy_ref plus RoadsideRequest.request_day matches the effective AssistanceCover row on port 2. Port 1 has at most one row per policyholder. Port 2 has at most one row whose valid_from is on or before request_day and whose null valid_until or valid_until on or after request_day makes it effective.

Port 0 metadata:
<Metadata id="RoadsideRequestIn"><Record name="RoadsideRequest" type="delimited"><Field name="dispatch_ref" type="string"/><Field name="policy_ref" type="long"/><Field name="request_day" type="date"/><Field name="quoted_fee_sgd" type="decimal"/><Field name="incident_code" type="string"/><Field name="service_area" type="string"/></Record></Metadata>
Port 1 metadata:
<Metadata id="PolicyholderIn"><Record name="Policyholder" type="delimited"><Field name="policy_ref" type="long"/><Field name="driver_display_name" type="string"/><Field name="assistance_tier" type="string"/><Field name="contact_confirmed" type="boolean" nullable="true"/></Record></Metadata>
Port 2 metadata:
<Metadata id="AssistanceCoverIn"><Record name="AssistanceCover" type="delimited"><Field name="policy_ref" type="long"/><Field name="valid_from" type="date"/><Field name="valid_until" type="date" nullable="true"/><Field name="member_copay_sgd" type="decimal" nullable="true"/><Field name="island_recovery_allowed" type="boolean"/></Record></Metadata>
Output metadata:
<Metadata id="DispatchScheduleOut"><Record name="DispatchSchedule" type="delimited"><Field name="dispatch_ref" type="string"/><Field name="driver_display_name" type="string"/><Field name="payable_fee_sgd" type="decimal"/><Field name="scheduling_status" type="string"/><Field name="scheduling_note" type="string"/></Record></Metadata>

Business logic:
- A missing policyholder produces driver_display_name UNKNOWN, payable_fee_sgd equal to quoted_fee_sgd, scheduling_status MANUAL_REVIEW, and scheduling_note POLICYHOLDER_NOT_FOUND.
- For a matched policyholder, use the effective assistance cover when it exists. payable_fee_sgd is member_copay_sgd when an effective cover exists; a null member_copay_sgd is zero. When no effective cover exists, payable_fee_sgd is quoted_fee_sgd. Round payable_fee_sgd to two decimals.
- For a matched policyholder, scheduling_status is MANUAL_REVIEW when either of these grouped conditions applies, using the listed precedence for scheduling_note:
  1. incident_code starts with MED- and contact_confirmed is false or null: MEDICAL_CONTACT_CHECK.
  2. service_area is ISLAND and either no effective assistance cover exists or island_recovery_allowed is false: ISLAND_RECOVERY_REVIEW.
- Otherwise scheduling_status is SCHEDULED and scheduling_note is null.

PROPOSED CTL2 CODE:
```ctl
//#CTL2

function integer transform() {
    $out.0.dispatch_ref = $in.0.dispatch_ref;

    boolean hasPolicyholder = !isnull($in.1.policy_ref);
    if (!hasPolicyholder) {
        $out.0.driver_display_name = "UNKNOWN";
        $out.0.payable_fee_sgd = $in.0.quoted_fee_sgd;
        $out.0.scheduling_status = "MANUAL_REVIEW";
        $out.0.scheduling_note = "POLICYHOLDER_NOT_FOUND";
        return ALL;
    }

    $out.0.driver_display_name = $in.1.driver_display_name;

    boolean hasEffectiveCover = !isnull($in.2.policy_ref)
        && !isnull($in.0.request_day)
        && !isnull($in.2.valid_from)
        && $in.2.valid_from <= $in.0.request_day
        && (isnull($in.2.valid_until) || $in.2.valid_until >= $in.0.request_day);

    decimal payableFee;
    if (hasEffectiveCover) {
        payableFee = nvl($in.2.member_copay_sgd, 0D);
    } else {
        payableFee = $in.0.quoted_fee_sgd;
    }
    $out.0.payable_fee_sgd = round(payableFee, 2);

    if (!isnull($in.0.incident_code)
        && startsWith($in.0.incident_code, "MED-")
        && (isnull($in.1.contact_confirmed) || !$in.1.contact_confirmed)) {
        $out.0.scheduling_status = "MANUAL_REVIEW";
        $out.0.scheduling_note = "MEDICAL_CONTACT_CHECK";
    } else if ($in.0.service_area == "ISLAND"
        && (!hasEffectiveCover
            || !nvl($in.2.island_recovery_allowed, false))) {
        $out.0.scheduling_status = "MANUAL_REVIEW";
        $out.0.scheduling_note = "ISLAND_RECOVERY_REVIEW";
    } else {
        $out.0.scheduling_status = "SCHEDULED";
        $out.0.scheduling_note = null;
    }

    return ALL;
}
```

