- Set payment_status to DOCUMENT_REVIEW when payment_hold is true or customs_release_date is null. Set review_reason to PAYMENT_HOLD when payment_hold is true; otherwise use CUSTOMS_RELEASE_MISSING.
- For records not in DOCUMENT_REVIEW, set payment_status to INVALID_INVOICE when billed_amount is less than or equal to zero, OVERDUE_PAYMENT when planned_payment_date is before the current graph date, PAYMENT_WINDOW when planned_payment_date is from the current graph date through the next 7 calendar days inclusive, and SCHEDULED_PAYMENT otherwise.
- amount_for_payment equals billed_amount only for OVERDUE_PAYMENT and PAYMENT_WINDOW; it is zero for all other statuses.
