SPECIFICATION:
1. Each group contains at most 100000 readings; every non-null integer quantity is between -10000 and 10000. Group nonempty inputs by batch; emit exactly one summary and no per-input batch_readings.
2. Count all batch_readings, and batch_accepted batch_readings whose treatment is in the list [CLEAN, OTHER].
3. Sum non-null minutes, ignoring null values. Sum zero-based month numbers of non-null observed dates, ignoring null dates.
4. batch_share is batch_accepted batch_readings divided by all batch_readings as a real number.
5. batch_suffix is the group key without its first character only when the last row's treatment is exactly CLEAN; otherwise empty.
6. baseline is the epoch date (1970-01-01T00:00:00Z). Group accumulators are fresh null fields until initialized.

