Heritage railway restoration cost sources

Specification:
1. Use two left outer slaves: port0 work ticket has units integer 1..100; port1 contract has nullable agreed_rate number 0..1000; port2 tariff has nullable default_rate number 0..1000.
2. Prefer a present agreed_rate, including zero. Otherwise use present default_rate. With neither available emit total=0.0 and source NONE.
3. With a contract rate source is CONTRACT; with only a tariff source is TARIFF. Compute total=units*selected rate. Emit tariff_month=getMonth(effective), preserving null for absent tariff dates.

Metadata:
Input port 0: {"name": "WorkTicket", "type": "delimited", "fields": [{"name": "units", "type": "integer", "nullable": "false"}]}
Input port 1: {"name": "ContractRate", "type": "delimited", "fields": [{"name": "agreed_rate", "type": "number", "nullable": "true"}]}
Input port 2: {"name": "TariffRate", "type": "delimited", "fields": [{"name": "default_rate", "type": "number", "nullable": "true"}, {"name": "effective", "type": "date", "nullable": "true"}]}
Output port 0: {"name": "RestorationPrice", "type": "delimited", "fields": [{"name": "total", "type": "number", "nullable": "false"}, {"name": "source", "type": "string", "nullable": "false"}, {"name": "tariff_month", "type": "integer", "nullable": "true"}]}

Current transform:
```ctl
//#CTL2
function integer transform() {
    number rate;
    if ($in.1.agreed_rate > 0.0) {
        rate = $in.1.agreed_rate;
        $out.0.source = "CONTRACT";
    } else if (!isnull($in.2.default_rate)) {
        rate = $in.1.agreed_rate;
        $out.0.source = "TARIFF";
    } else {
        $out.0.source = "NONE";
    }
    $out.0.total = $in.0.units * rate;
    $out.0.tariff_month = getMonth($in.2.effective);
    return ALL;
}
```

